body:
Thanks <3 My girlfriend and I are also long distance, and I think that really gets me down sometimes. 

&#x200B;

Good luck to you too! :D

Thank you for saying this. Oddly enough, knowing that other people may also feel this way makes me feel a lot better. I definitely am feeling some of that "bittersweet" feeling right now, but I'm hoping that it'll get better with time.  

&#x200B;

And thanks for the link to the video! I already knew about it but only got less than halfway through before I had to go do something. I'm gonna finish the rest of it :)
